  "project_description": "This modules adds a link formatter that transform a link field output in a \"button like\" Bootstrap anchor.\n\n Back to top \n\n Installation \n \n Install module as usual: Install contrib modules \n Load bootstrap library CSS as you wish, usually as part of a theme \n \n Back to top \n\n Configuration \n \n Goto selected entity view mode and select \"Button as Link \n \n Back to top \n\n Advanced \n All formating is done thru a twig template link-formatter-button-link.html.twig and its preprocess function for extra flexibility.\n\n Back to top",
